      "x": 140,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 72,
      "text": "🔄 Phase Pipeline (Plugin-Specific)\nTravel: Discover → Intent → Plan → Prepare → Experience → Reflect\nFinance: Assess → Diagnose → Plan → Execute → Review\nHealth: Baseline → Research → Plan → Habit → Review\nCareer: Where You Are → Market Research → Strategy → Execute → Grow\nEach phase has a leadPrompt (AI opens) + objectives + description",
      "originalText": "🔄 Phase Pipeline (Plugin-Specific)\nTravel: Discover → Intent → Plan → Prepare → Experience → Reflect\nFinance: Assess → Diagnose → Plan → Execute → Review\nHealth: Baseline → Research → Plan → Habit → Review\nCareer: Where You Are → Market Research → Strategy → Execute → Grow\nEach phase has a leadPrompt (AI opens) + objectives + description",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "phase-flow",
      "autoResize": true
